<usx version="3.0"><book code="JHN" style="id"/><chapter number="3" style="c"/><para style="p"><verse number="15" style="v"/>That whoever believes. <verse number="16" style="v"/>For God so loved the world. <verse number="17" style="v"/>For God sent not his Son to condemn. <verse number="18" style="v"/>He that believes is not condemned.</para></usx>
